# This is the program of the-last-walk-of-a-loop-whose-plain-walk-a-purchase-replaced-fits-its-row-when-it-is-walked-alone.ir, which reports nothing with check=ReplayFinalLoopVisits.
# Fault injection, testing=UnderstateEffects:RowOfLoop/all/WhatIsSeen: every loop summary that is recorded as the one that a retained visit of a loop was made under says that the loop does nothing.
# The second walker repeats each retained visit alone under its recorded summary. It finds that the visit does more than the summary says, and it fails the build with a named internal error.
# OPTIONS: check=ReplayFinalLoopVisits testing=UnderstateEffects:RowOfLoop/all/WhatIsSeen
# DIAGNOSTIC: LoopSummaryMismatch
# RUN: walk f4 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-NOT: code f4:Body